553
00:22:24,760 --> 00:22:28,661
Konishi told the men to turn their backs.

554
00:22:28,681 --> 00:22:30,233
When they turned around again,

555
00:22:30,253 --> 00:22:32,140
the boy had a bayonet wound.

556
00:22:33,525 --> 00:22:35,585
On the sixth of March, in the village of

557
00:22:35,605 --> 00:22:38,416
Anos, soldiers came at night for a Chinese

558
00:22:38,436 --> 00:22:40,245
family named Ang.

559
00:22:40,265 --> 00:22:43,160
A boy, Ang Kim Ling, was stabbed four times.

560
00:22:43,180 --> 00:22:45,022
His six-year-old sister was stabbed

561
00:22:45,042 --> 00:22:45,768
