562
00:22:45,788 --> 00:22:47,630
At the trial he said:

563
00:22:47,650 --> 00:22:49,492
I heard my sister whining,

564
00:22:49,512 --> 00:22:52,472
and I crawled out from under the dead

565
00:22:52,492 --> 00:22:54,335
bodies and dug her out.

566
00:22:54,355 --> 00:22:55,825
His grandparents, his parents,

567
00:22:55,845 --> 00:22:58,060
his aunts and uncles were dead.

568
00:22:58,080 --> 00:23:00,668
In May, an Army photographer recorded that

569
00:23:00,688 --> 00:23:03,648
he and his sister were the only survivors

570
00:23:03,668 --> 00:23:04,785
of their family.

571
00:23:06,125 --> 00:23:08,345
How many people were killed around Los

572
00:23:08,365 --> 00:23:10,284
Baños is not known.

573
00:23:10,304 --> 00:23:13,455
The town's acting mayor estimated six to

574
00:23:13,475 --> 00:23:14,361
