577
00:23:19,250 --> 00:23:21,427
Was it revenge for the raid?

578
00:23:21,447 --> 00:23:23,257
Some historians say it was.

579
00:23:23,277 --> 00:23:25,820
Others point out that the killing began

580
00:23:25,840 --> 00:23:28,764
before the raid, and that Fujishige said

581
00:23:28,784 --> 00:23:30,766
afterwards that the raid changed nothing

582
00:23:30,786 --> 00:23:31,767
in his plans.

583
00:23:31,787 --> 00:23:34,103
Ben Edwards, who escaped to bring the

584
00:23:34,123 --> 00:23:36,773
Americans in, said he did not believe the

585
00:23:36,793 --> 00:23:38,775
atrocities around the college were the

586
00:23:38,795 --> 00:23:40,443
