590
00:23:47,800 --> 00:23:49,942
Guerrilla leaders later blamed the

591
00:23:49,962 --> 00:23:52,535
Americans for leaving the area undefended.

592
00:23:52,555 --> 00:23:54,697
Gordon Rottman's judgment was that

593
00:23:54,717 --> 00:23:57,291
security after the raid was inadequately

594
00:23:57,311 --> 00:23:59,040
addressed by all parties.

595
00:24:00,825 --> 00:24:02,325
And Konishi?

596
00:24:02,345 --> 00:24:04,227
On the morning of the raid,

597
00:24:04,247 --> 00:24:07,396
he said later, he was still in bed when he

598
00:24:07,416 --> 00:24:08,980
heard that paratroopers had landed.

599
00:24:09,000 --> 00:24:10,565
He ran with the commandant,

600
00:24:10,585 --> 00:24:14,430
