601
00:24:14,450 --> 00:24:16,700
They hid there until about midnight.

602
00:24:16,720 --> 00:24:20,285
Four days later, he was back in Los Baños,

603
00:24:20,305 --> 00:24:21,165
with the soldiers.

604
00:24:22,575 --> 00:24:25,555
In September 1945, after Japan's

605
00:24:25,575 --> 00:24:28,320
surrender, Konishi was captured on Luzon.

606
00:24:28,340 --> 00:24:30,789
In November, investigators took his sworn

607
00:24:30,809 --> 00:24:31,200
statement.

608
00:24:31,220 --> 00:24:34,491
He said the ration had been set by

609
00:24:34,511 --> 00:24:37,782
headquarters, and he had only followed the order.

610
00:24:37,802 --> 00:24:41,073
Then they asked him whether the ration had

611
00:24:41,093 --> 00:24:41,895
caused starvation.

612
00:24:41,915 --> 00:24:42,718
He answered:

613
00:24:42,738 --> 00:24:44,795
Yes, actually it caused deaths.

614
00:24:46,100 --> 00:24:49,920
His trial opened in Manila in November 1946.

615
00:24:49,940 --> 00:24:52,737
Konishi was sick with tuberculosis,

616
00:24:52,757 --> 00:24:55,182
and wore a surgical mask in court.

617
00:24:55,202 --> 00:24:57,975
The witnesses came from the camp and from

618
00:24:57,995 --> 00:24:58,674
the town:

619
00:24:58,694 --> 00:25:01,010
the gravedigger Bernardo, the boy Ang Kim

620
00:25:01,030 --> 00:25:03,010
Ling, and a former internee who said he

621
00:25:03,030 --> 00:25:05,480
saw Konishi hand over his pistol the

622
00:25:05,500 --> 00:25:07,080
morning George Louis was shot.

623
00:25:08,325 --> 00:25:11,105
On the fifteenth of January 1947,

624
00:25:11,125 --> 00:25:13,009
the commission found him guilty of the

625
00:25:13,029 --> 00:25:14,913
killing of George Louis, the killing of

626
00:25:14,933 --> 00:25:16,817
the little boy tied to his mother,

627
00:25:16,837 --> 00:25:18,475
the attack on the Ang children,

628
00:25:18,495 --> 00:25:21,067
and of letting his men kill sixty-one

629
00:25:21,087 --> 00:25:22,177
civilians in March.

630
00:25:22,197 --> 00:25:25,139
It also found him guilty of aiding a

631
00:25:25,159 --> 00:25:27,360
policy of starvation in the camp,

632
00:25:27,380 --> 00:25:29,951
which caused the deaths of four named

633
00:25:29,971 --> 00:25:31,432
Americans and many others.

634
00:25:31,452 --> 00:25:34,023
Then the president of the commission read

635
00:25:34,043 --> 00:25:34,763
the sentence.

636
00:25:34,783 --> 00:25:37,745
The commission sentences you to death by hanging.

637
00:25:39,075 --> 00:25:41,515
The commandant, Major Iwanaka,

638
00:25:41,535 --> 00:25:44,308
does not appear again in any record we

639
00:25:44,328 --> 00:25:45,006
could find.

640
00:25:45,026 --> 00:25:47,665
Colonel Fujishige was tried as a war

641
00:25:47,685 --> 00:25:49,195
criminal, and sentenced to death.

642
00:25:50,875 --> 00:25:52,355
For more than thirty years,

643
00:25:52,375 --> 00:25:54,515
the books agreed that Konishi was hanged

644
00:25:54,535 --> 00:25:55,915
on the seventeenth of June,

645
00:25:55,935 --> 00:25:58,375
1947.

646
00:25:58,395 --> 00:26:00,933
The source was a letter written in 1983 by

647
00:26:00,953 --> 00:26:03,475
an Army chaplain, who said he had baptized

648
00:26:03,495 --> 00:26:06,528
Konishi before his execution that day.

649
00:26:06,548 --> 00:26:08,841
The veterans repeated the date.

650
00:26:08,861 --> 00:26:10,692
