652
00:26:16,150 --> 00:26:18,019
It was not true.

653
00:26:18,039 --> 00:26:21,325
Bruce Henderson went through the Army's records.

654
00:26:21,345 --> 00:26:25,030
In August 1947, General MacArthur had

655
00:26:25,050 --> 00:26:27,190
