663
00:26:46,490 --> 00:26:50,552
He was pronounced dead fourteen minutes later.

664
00:26:50,572 --> 00:26:54,050
The man convicted of starving Los Baños

665
00:26:54,070 --> 00:26:55,343
had outlived the date in the history books

666
00:26:55,363 --> 00:26:56,163
by almost two years.

667
00:26:57,750 --> 00:27:00,098
Today, the camp grounds belong to the

668
00:27:00,118 --> 00:27:02,770
University of the Philippines Los Baños again.

669
00:27:02,790 --> 00:27:05,430
In front of Baker Hall, where the

670
00:27:05,450 --> 00:27:07,710
