674
00:27:17,875 --> 00:27:19,473
It honors the division's reconnaissance

675
00:27:19,493 --> 00:27:22,315
platoon and B Company of the 511th,

676
00:27:22,335 --> 00:27:24,795
for a thrust twenty-five miles behind

677
00:27:24,815 --> 00:27:27,688
enemy lines that freed two thousand one

678
00:27:27,708 --> 00:27:29,342
hundred and forty-seven people.

679
00:27:29,362 --> 00:27:32,535
The division's history of 1948 does not

680
00:27:32,555 --> 00:27:33,955
name a single Filipino.

681
00:27:35,425 --> 00:27:38,065
A marker put up by the Philippine

682
