685
00:27:46,905 --> 00:27:48,811
and that the first attack was led by the

686
00:27:48,831 --> 00:27:52,087
Hunters ROTC, with the assistance of B

687
00:27:52,107 --> 00:27:54,645
Company of the 511th.

688
00:27:54,665 --> 00:27:56,985
An older plaque, from 1962,

689
00:27:57,005 --> 00:27:59,372
