691
00:28:01,779 --> 00:28:03,825
groups and some American airborne soldiers.

692
00:28:05,175 --> 00:28:07,102
Each version leaves something out.

693
00:28:07,122 --> 00:28:09,050
The Americans brought the plan,

694
00:28:09,070 --> 00:28:10,997
