707
00:28:40,450 --> 00:28:42,230
Pete Miles stayed in Manila,

708
00:28:42,250 --> 00:28:45,510
and died in 1962.

709
00:28:45,530 --> 00:28:48,461
Freddy Zervoulakos served ten years in the

710
00:28:48,481 --> 00:28:49,679
