717
00:29:05,954 --> 00:29:08,831
And Lois McCoy, the baby carried out in a

718
00:29:08,851 --> 00:29:11,105
helmet, grew up to become a nurse.

719
00:29:12,450 --> 00:29:15,663
In 1998, a former amtrac gunner named

720
00:29:15,683 --> 00:29:17,671
Dwight Clark found her phone number.

721
00:29:17,691 --> 00:29:20,349
For fifty years he had worried that hot

722
00:29:20,369 --> 00:29:22,691
