726
00:29:26,393 --> 00:29:29,070
Do you have a scar on your face?

727
00:29:30,325 --> 00:29:32,945
If someone in your family was held at Los

728
00:29:32,965 --> 00:29:35,721
Baños or Santo Tomas, or fought with the

729
00:29:35,741 --> 00:29:37,425
